{"series":{"id":"cheng-he-ti-tong","slug":"cheng-he-ti-tong","title":"Cheng He Ti Tong","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/cheng-he-ti-tong-2__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"Yu Wanyin es teletransportado a una novela sobre luchas palaciegas. La protagonista femenina de la novela también es teletransportada a ella. Para invertir su destino de villana, Yu Wanyin decide unir fuerzas con un tirano, que también resulta ser un hombre moderno teletransportado. Yu Wanyin espera que los tres transmigrados dejen a un lado las luchas palaciegas y se dediquen a jugar a las cartas y a comer juntos pacíficamente. Sin embargo, la protagonista femenina cree que ella es la elegida, y sigue optando por ir en contra del equipo de Yu Wanyin y el protagonista masculino, el rey Duan. Así, Yu Wanyin tiene que llevar a cabo una serie de acciones para sobrevivir y ayudar a la dinastía Xia a prevenir la crisis de la sequía...","genres":["Drama","Romance","Comedia","Reencarnación"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/cheng-he-ti-tong","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:33:42.133Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"cheng-he-ti-tong-1","slug":"cheng-he-ti-tong-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/cheng-he-ti-tong-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"cheng-he-ti-tong","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/cheng-he-ti-tong-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:25.063Z","episodeCount":24,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":24,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true},{"id":"cheng-he-ti-tong-2","slug":"cheng-he-ti-tong-2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/cheng-he-ti-tong-2-1","image":null,"number":2,"seriesId":"cheng-he-ti-tong","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/cheng-he-ti-tong-2-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:11.165Z","episodeCount":24,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":24,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"cheng-he-ti-tong-1-1","slug":"cheng-he-ti-tong-1-1","